      "heading": "The short version.",
      "html": "<ul class=\"site-words\"><li>Servers in the EU, on Hetzner.</li><li>HTTPS between you and Quickler.</li><li>Backups every minute, off-site, restore-tested every month, with a monthly copy locked for 12 months.</li><li>New code reaches the live product only when the founder says so and confirms with an authenticator code.</li><li>Errors are reported to Sentry; uptime is public on our <a href=\"/status/\">status page</a>.</li><li>Registered with the ICO, ZC124993.</li><li>Not yet: disk encryption on our own servers. More below.</li></ul>"
