      "heading": "Hetzner servers in the EU.",
      "html": "<p class=\"site-words\">The product runs on Hetzner servers in the EU. The AI services we use do not train their models on your content. Records, photos and voice notes are deleted three years after the last activity on a Record, or sooner if you delete them. Every change to a Record is kept, with who made it and when. The privacy policy lists every company that handles data for us and why.</p>"
