      "html": "<p class=\"site-words\">Everything between you and Quickler uses HTTPS (TLS 1.3 on app.quickler.co). We have not yet turned on disk encryption on our own servers. It was on the action list of our last data protection assessment, on 14 August 2026, and we will not claim it until it is done.</p>"
