      "type": "raw",
      "heading": "Every minute, kept somewhere else.",
      "html": "<p class=\"site-words\">The two product databases are copied off-site to Backblaze every 60 seconds, so we can go back to any point in the last 7 days. A nightly copy is also taken on the server and kept for 3 days. Once a month a full copy goes to Backblaze and is locked for 12 months, so nobody, including us, can delete it early. Photos and voice notes are copied off-site every night. Once a month we restore the live database from the off-site copy and run a database integrity check on it. The latest check, on 1 November 2026, passed.</p>"
